Export both convolution history and recurrent state at the exact interior
positions selected by the shared allocator. Recompute normalized prefill
prefixes through the existing FLA chunk kernel; keep full-row outputs intact.
Default off; explicit opt-in requires CUDA Triton/FLA and align caching.
Disable cross-group metadata reuse for checkpoint-enabled GDN groups.
Prefix recomputation is a correctness implementation, not a performance claim.

Kind: feature
What: opt-in exact interior GDN convolution and recurrent checkpoints by prefix recomputation
Upstream: HyperQwen PR #392
Cut-against: 0.31.0
Retires-when: upstream GDN exports exact interior checkpoint states

